<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Divine deliverance e’er slays man by the cross;</l><l>Though cruel it may seem, it is a grand release.</l><l>Christ ne’er will be our life if we escape the cross;</l><l>Christ ne’er will be expressed but by our sure decease.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The cross’s final goal, that God’s will be fulfilled;</l><l>His will’s arch enemy is but the self of man.</l><l>If self be done away and all the soul-life killed,</l><l>God’s will shall then prevail and prospered be His plan.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
